    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# Sunday Coach \nThis is my weekly review of my marathon training. Reads my own apps' data (JAVA and Elevate, on Supabase), asks an AI coach agent for a review, eases next week's hardest session if I'm too fatigued, and sends a voice note in my ElevenLabs-cloned voice to me via Telegram. Neat huh!?",
